{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17159","headline":"奉和圣制中春麟德殿会百寮观新乐 · 权德舆","name":"奉和圣制中春麟德殿会百寮观新乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仲春蔼芳景，内庭宴羣臣。\n森森列干戚，济济趋钩陈。\n大乐本天地，中和序人伦。\n正声迈咸濩，易象含羲文。\n玉俎映朝服，金钿明舞茵。\n韶光雪初霁，圣藻风自薫。\n时泰恩泽溥，功成行缀新。\n赓歌仰昭回，窃比华封人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}